enchantment.simplemod.bloodlust.desc=Increases damage based on the attacker's missing health. Higher levels improve the bonus.
enchantment.simplemod.crit.desc=Grants a chance to perform a critical hit even when not jumping. Higher levels increase the chance.
enchantment.simplemod.crit_damage.desc=Increases the damage of critical hits. Higher levels provide more bonus.
enchantment.simplemod.double_crit.desc=When you score a critical hit, has a chance to deal extra damage. Higher levels increase the chance and damage.
enchantment.simplemod.execute.desc=Deals bonus damage proportional to the target's missing health. Higher levels increase the percentage.
enchantment.simplemod.flight.desc=Allows the wearer to fly, but consumes hunger and durability over time. Higher levels reduce consumption.
enchantment.simplemod.healer.desc=Converts damage dealt into healing for the target, canceling the damage and restoring health.
enchantment.simplemod.healing_blade.desc=Heals the attacker for a portion of damage dealt, with overflow turning into absorption. Higher levels improve healing.
enchantment.simplemod.infinite_power.desc=Grants flight, invincibility, instant mining, infinite food and durability, laser attack, multiplied loot, soulbound items, and an infinite storage bag.
enchantment.simplemod.item_fixer.desc=Slowly repairs the item over time. Conflicts with Mending.
enchantment.simplemod.void_protection.desc=When falling into the void, teleports you to y=256 and consumes one level of the enchantment.
enchantment.simplemod.double_strike.desc=Every attack has a chance to trigger an extra strike.
enchantment.simplemod.effect_bonus.desc=Increases damage based on the number of active potion effects on the target. Higher levels improve the multiplier.
enchantment.simplemod.immortal.desc=Grants a chance to completely negate incoming damage after accumulating hits. Higher levels increase the chance and negate more consecutive hits.
enchantment.simplemod.saturation.desc=Slowly restores hunger and saturation over time. Higher levels restore faster and more per trigger.
enchantment.simplemod.acid_attack.desc=Damages the target's held weapon on hit. Higher levels deal more durability damage.
enchantment.simplemod.armor_breaker.desc=Damages a random piece of the target's armor on hit. Higher levels deal more durability damage.
enchantment.simplemod.assassin.desc=Instantly executes targets whose health is below a threshold after the hit. The threshold scales with level.
enchantment.simplemod.damage_limiter.desc=Reduces incoming hits to a percentage of your max health. Damage above a higher threshold pierces through. Higher levels increase both the reduction and the pierce threshold.
enchantment.simplemod.aoe_attack.desc=On hit, if other attackable enemies are near the target, the damage is split among all of them. The total damage pool is the original hit multiplied by the level, capped at 100% per enemy. Higher levels cover larger groups and keep more damage on each target.
enchantment.simplemod.charged_strike.desc=Each hit stores a portion of its damage. Your next hit releases the stored damage as bonus. Released damage is never stored again. Higher levels store more per hit.
